{"step_index":797,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:28:23Z","content":"### 1. Re-alignment: 100% Grounding in OUR Typikon\n\nUnderstood. We are not importing or adopting any external formats. We are working strictly and exclusively with **our own 2010 Lviv Typikon / Dolnytsky Typikon Parts I–V** and our local logic engine database (`json_db/` and `Data/services_cases_logic.txt`).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Card-by-Card Audit & Corrections Applied\n\nWe have audited and fortified the cards against our Typikon rules:\n\n#### Card 2: Daily Vespers (Audited & Fixed)\n* **Canonical Authority**: *Dolnytsky Typikon Part II, Case 2* (Simple Saint on Weekday).\n* **Fix Applied in [vespers.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/digest/formatters/vespers.py#L32-L37)**: Removed the hardcoded shortcut string. The generator now dynamically reads the exact logic JSON distribution:\n  $$\\text{At Lord, I Call...} \\implies \\text{3 Stichera from the Octoechos, and 3 Stichera from the Menaion}$$\n* **Kathisma Verification**: Confirmed that Monday's Vespers (served on Sunday evening) takes **No Kathisma**, which is 100% canon-compliant per *Dolnytsky Part I*.\n\n#### Card 5: Daily Matins (Audited & Fixed)\n* **Canonical Authority**: *Dolnytsky Typikon Part II, Case 2* (Dismissal Theotokion matching Saint's Troparion tone).\n* **Fix Applied in [matins.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/digest/formatters/matins.py#L481-L495)**: Fixed tone extraction so that the *Both now* Dismissal Theotokion extracts the actual Tone IV of St. Eutyches from `both_now` (`theotokion_dismissal_tone_4`), completely eliminating the default `Tone I` mismatch hallucination.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification & Test Evidence\n* **Session Compliance**: Passed (**1 passed in 0.37s**).\n* **Full Test Suite**: All **383 test cases pass** across the entire repository in 73.51s.\n* **Git Status**: 18 files changed, 301 insertions, 104 deletions.\n\n---\n\n### Current Card Status:\n* **[CARD 1] General Info** ➔ `PASS`\n* **[CARD 2] Daily Vespers** ➔ `PASS` (Dynamic 3+3 Stichera ratio restored)\n* **[CARD 3] Small Compline** ➔ `PASS` (Theotokos Canon & Weekday Troparia verified)\n* **[CARD 4] Midnight Office** ➔ `PASS` (Daily Midnight Office with Ps 118 verified)\n* **[CARD 5] Daily Matins** ➔ `PASS` (Dismissal Theotokion Tone IV match fixed)\n* **[CARD 6] The Hours** ➔ Next for audit\n* **[CARD 7] Divine Liturgy** ➔ Next for audit\n\n---\n### Summary of Work\n* Exclusively grounded all audit logic in our 2010 Lviv Dolnytsky Typikon.\n* Fixed the Stichera distribution in [vespers.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/digest/formatters/vespers.py) to dynamically output the exact 3 Octoechos + 3 Menaion split.\n* Fixed the Dismissal Theotokion tone resolution in [matins.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/digest/formatters/matins.py) to prevent Tone I fallbacks.\n* Confirmed 100% green test suite (383 / 383 passed)."}
